## PATH MAPPING — CLINE vs ATLAS
Cline runs locally on Prometheus/Windows inside VS Code.
The Cline workspace root is: C:\ecosistema\TRIDENT_Project

Canonical local files for Cline reading are relative to that workspace root:
- CLINE_CONTEXT_BUNDLE.md
- docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
- docs/SECURITY_DEBT.md

Atlas Linux paths are runtime/source paths ONLY (for Obscura/commands), NOT for Cline `read_file`:
- /home/morris2/trident_kb/...

Rule: If Cline is opened locally on Windows, use Windows/relative paths. Do not pass Linux Atlas paths to `read_file`.
